r /> Even a dramatic failure on a roll probably constitutes human interaction if it at least goes on longer then an instant drink in the face. <br /> You could have a mail conversation with strangers, like a mail-friend. Use online communication.<br /> If anchilla or elder, visits old friends and say you're a local historian, wanting to hear the tales of their lives.<br /> Chitchat with your neighbours. Get a ghostwriter to listen to your story.<br /> Talk to the servants of other vampires, just for chat, not to use them to get secrets( or go ahead )<br /> Call in to the local radio and smalltalk with the host.<br /> Take up old lost childhood friends.<br /> Use tinder<br /> Catch a uber or taxi and talk with the driver.<br /> <br /> It's like most people, talk with them, ineract. <br /> <br /> That's the thing with Humanity, it makes you don't want or care about others, you have to keep trying. <br /> But then again it's only hard for vampires lower then 4 in humanity. You could always take a interesting ghoul and talk with.<br /> <br /> Or make it your way of feeding, no blood without a descent conversation before hand ( like im not that kind a vamp that eats on the first date). <br /> Cultivate a heard of blooddolls, they'll probably not care if you're a huge non-understanding pale dead guy as long as having a small conversation gets them their fix.<br /> Befriend small children, you're maybe not as judgemental to you as grown ups, help them with something and you got a friend, possibly a new life long relation if cultivated properly.<br /> If you have dominate you could ask people kindly to sleep spoon with you while you rest so you get the warm touch of a relationship. ( with the added benefit that they dont quite remember).<br /> If you have obfuscate you could share a bed with someone as long as you're a bit careful (and that resting counts as a scene). <br /> If you have subsume the lesser beast you can posses the family cat or dog and get some interaction g